Acceptance criteria:
  A Windows x64 .msi exists in release with a matching receipt and SHA-256 file.
  Setup is per-user; bundled patched Python needs no system Python/pip/PATH modifications.
  First-launch downloads are explicit, binary-only and hash verified with TLS verification.
  Existing verified HTTPS mirrors may be used without persisting private feed settings.
  Models, camera capture and OBS-driver installation never start automatically.
  Installed CLI/GUI/helper resources work without a source checkout.
  Uninstall removes installed files/shortcut and preserves per-user data.
  Source archive and installer provenance remain separate and current.
  Actual installation evidence remains separate from owner usability approval.

